      *================================================================*
      * STUB OF THE IBM-SUPPLIED DFHAID COPYBOOK - ONLY THE KEYS THE   *
      * COREBANK PROGRAMS USE, FOR THE OFFLINE SYNTAX CHECK. ON A REAL *
      * CICS SYSTEM THE IBM COPYBOOK IS USED INSTEAD.                  *
      *================================================================*
       01  DFHAID.
           05  DFHNULL                 PIC X VALUE X'00'.
           05  DFHENTER                PIC X VALUE X'7D'.
           05  DFHCLEAR                PIC X VALUE X'6D'.
           05  DFHPF3                  PIC X VALUE X'F3'.
           05  DFHPF5                  PIC X VALUE X'F5'.
